  "body": "[CuTe, SM100] Unify hd256 forward and recover the remaining stack\n\nBring the changes from #2921-#2927 and #2949 onto main. The earlier\nstack PRs were merged into their parent branches rather than main;\n#2928 and #2920 already landed and are not replayed here.\n\nRun hd256 on the general forward, including 2CTA/S ping-pong support,\nchunked SplitKV output, scheduler fixes and feature coverage. Preserve\ncanonicalize_singletons and MLA align_bits. Include the TMEM unaligned\nbarrier fix and its two regression cases.\n\nThe resulting source matches tested stack tip 3a92e768, except for\nmain's newer apache-tvm-ffi dependency bound. Focused validation:\n56 passed, 2 known block-sparse/PackGQA skips; both TMEM regression\ncases passed synccheck with zero errors. Separate pipeline-acquire\nMissing wait findings remain outside this fix.",
